Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.63,0:00:02.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,说好的一瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.38,0:00:04.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如何
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.92,0:00:06.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,行了行了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.75,0:00:08.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你这拂尘的毛都快抹我一脸了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.88,0:00:14.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.92,0:00:17.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你要回鬼市了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.50,0:00:20.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你不是也要回仙京了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.67,0:00:23.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.13,0:00:25.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你要是想跟我回鬼市
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.04,0:00:26.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.04,0:00:28.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,下次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.79,0:00:31.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有机会你重修极乐坊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.92,0:00:33.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我去给你搬砖
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.63,0:00:37.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,搬砖不必
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.75,0:00:40.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你坐着看也挺好的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.25,0:00:43.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,千秋的事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.38,0:00:45.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不管怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.00,0:00:47.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还是多谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.75,0:00:50.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我不知道怎样才是对的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.88,0:00:52.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,或许
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.75,0:00:54.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这样也未尝不好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.88,0:00:55.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,想太多
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.67,0:00:59.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你只管做就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.88,0:03:14.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.25,0:03:16.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,挺够意思的呀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.25,0:03:18.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是怎么结交到的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.29,0:03:20.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.50,0:03:22.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你运气可真好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.13,0:03:24.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.25,0:03:27.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大概吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.75,0:03:28.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也这么觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.17,0:03:37.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,风信
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.54,0:03:38.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,对不住啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.13,0:03:41.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,技不如人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.29,0:03:42.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没什么好说的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.38,0:03:46.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好啦好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.42,0:03:47.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.04,0:03:50.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,进去确认一下还有没有漏网之鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.29,0:03:51.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,咱们就回仙京吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.21,0:04:03.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.29,0:04:04.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这没有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.00,0:04:10.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,花城居然倒打一耙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.58,0:04:12.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,说上天庭在鬼市安插眼线
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.63,0:04:13.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,荒谬至极
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.88,0:04:16.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们天界需要在他手下安插眼线
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.38,0:04:21.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.29,0:04:23.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,您话可别说这么早
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.88,0:04:25.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,风师大人回来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.13,0:04:28.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这次去鬼市
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.50,0:04:30.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,风师大人您辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.25,0:04:31.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.04,0:04:32.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,应该的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.46,0:04:50.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,以往
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.33,0:04:52.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一两个月都不一定开一场集议
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.42,0:04:54.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如今事故频发
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.08,0:04:56.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,恨不得一天议两次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.63,0:04:59.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也怪不得帝君疲累了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.92,0:05:02.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这血雨探花说来就来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.88,0:05:04.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,说走还就能走
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.04,0:05:05.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,今天他能轻而易举
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.33,0:05:07.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,把得罪他的太子殿下抓走
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.17,0:05:09.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,明天岂不是也能抓走别的神官
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.13,0:05:10.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这事万万不能姑息
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.88,0:05:12.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,必须得及时遏止啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.25,0:05:15.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,花城坐拥一个鬼市
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.17,0:05:16.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,信徒那么多
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.63,0:05:18.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,会在乎区区一个极乐坊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.29,0:05:20.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我看呐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.88,0:05:23.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不一定是因为太子殿下得罪了他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.63,0:05:25.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,才闯仙京的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.29,0:05:27.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,玄真将军
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.50,0:05:28.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你这话就不对了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.63,0:05:31.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大家可都是亲耳听到
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.67,0:05:33.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,花城自己承认了的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.67,0:05:35.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,说起来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.75,0:05:37.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,本月是轮到哪位将军守庭
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.75,0:05:40.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,仙乐宫的大门给人施了法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.63,0:05:41.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,连到别处
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.13,0:05:43.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,竟然毫无察觉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.25,0:05:45.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.13,0:05:46.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,算不算失职
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.42,0:05:49.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.38,0:05:52.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,本月当值的是我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.38,0:05:53.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,的确是我失职了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.96,0:05:59.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.38,0:06:01.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,依我看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.50,0:06:03.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,事情还是一件件来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.17,0:06:05.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,先把血洗鎏金宴的事弄清楚了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.67,0:06:07.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,帝君
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.50,0:06:10.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,泰华殿下有消息了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.75,0:06:12.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他说什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.88,0:06:14.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.21,0:06:17.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,永安国鎏金宴之事另有隐情
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.25,0:06:19.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他会自行处理
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.88,0:06:21.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,望旁人不要插手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.00,0:06:21.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什么隐情
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.00,0:06:24.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,具体没说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.63,0:06:25.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只提了句
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.04,0:06:28.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,务必不要让太子殿下自贬成功
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.50,0:06:30.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-这究竟是为何呀\N-泰华殿下是何用意
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.88,0:06:32.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,苦主都不找凶手讨债了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.75,0:06:34.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们还在这起什么劲呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.54,0:06:35.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.50,0:06:38.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,而且泰华殿下似乎也不愿说内情
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.25,0:06:39.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,真是连点嚼头都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.13,0:06:42.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,玄真
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.17,0:06:43.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,南阳
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.50,0:06:46.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你们一同协助明光
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.17,0:06:47.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,加强仙京警戒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.42,0:06:49.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.88,0:06:50.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,其余人等
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.25,0:06:52.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,继续排查
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.13,0:06:53.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.75,0:06:56.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,想不到这仙乐太子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.29,0:06:57.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,每次捅出什么娄子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.92,0:06:59.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,帝君说要审
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.00,0:07:00.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,之后都不了了之
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.38,0:07:02.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,原来是尊大佛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.25,0:07:03.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可不是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.25,0:07:04.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有眼不识泰山
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.75,0:07:06.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,今后说话小心点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.63,0:07:14.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,帝君
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.50,0:07:16.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,又给您添麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.67,0:07:19.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这还不算什么麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.50,0:07:23.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你若是一直咬死了血洗鎏金宴的是你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.13,0:07:25.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那才真的麻烦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.04,0:07:28.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,其实
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.75,0:07:42.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,事情的原委
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.17,0:07:43.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.13,0:07:45.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,仙乐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.38,0:07:48.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你这事做得真是吃力不讨好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.67,0:07:50.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,里外不是人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.25,0:07:53.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.88,0:07:54.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.04,0:07:56.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你一贯如此
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.25,0:07:59.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,泰华现在是去追青鬼了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.92,0:08:01.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但之后如何应对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.38,0:08:02.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你想好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.00,0:08:03.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还没
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.50,0:08:05.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不过眼下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.63,0:08:07.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我在想点别的事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.54,0:08:08.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.88,0:08:10.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有什么有趣点的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.42,0:08:11.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,让我也高兴一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.17,0:08:13.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,地师
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.13,0:08:15.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是您派去鬼市卧底的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.50,0:08:18.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.29,0:08:20.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这是为何
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.38,0:08:24.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,因为先对天界出手的那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.67,0:08:25.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是花城
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.88,0:08:28.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这么多年来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.29,0:08:31.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,花城的消息都太快
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.13,0:08:32.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太精准了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.17,0:08:34.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什么事可以做
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.63,0:08:36.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什么事不可以做
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.13,0:08:38.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哪里是底线
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.79,0:08:40.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如何擦边压线
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.75,0:08:42.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那些他本不应该知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.75,0:08:44.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他都一清二楚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.38,0:08:48.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这次更是直接把通道开到了你的仙乐宫
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.79,0:08:52.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若说上天庭没有他安插的内应
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.75,0:08:54.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,又如何能解释这一切
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.88,0:08:57.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,您有证据吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.29,0:09:03.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是苦于没有确凿的证据
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.50,0:09:05.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我才让明仪混入鬼界的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.13,0:09:08.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只是没想到
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.54,0:09:11.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,上天庭那只内鬼还没揪出来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.29,0:09:13.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,明仪反倒落入他手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.38,0:09:16.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这次万幸被你救了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.88,0:09:18.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但要再寻花城的眼线
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.38,0:09:21.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,恐怕就更加困难了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.04,0:09:23.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,出了问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.29,0:09:25.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是上天庭还是中天庭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.88,0:09:26.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,难说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.04,0:09:28.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你便当除了你之外
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.00,0:09:30.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,谁都有可能吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.50,0:09:32.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也许
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.42,0:09:33.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只有一个
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.13,0:09:34.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也许
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.29,0:09:36.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,更多
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.75,0:09:38.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.33,0:09:40.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就算是风信慕情
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.75,0:09:43.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,任何人都有可能吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.25,0:09:45.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,仙乐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.54,0:09:49.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我知道你现在一定对花城颇有好感
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.54,0:09:51.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但还是要多留个心眼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.67,0:09:53.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,别把什么底都透给他了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.38,0:09:57.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,世间能成绝者
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.29,0:10:00.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,无一不是经历了非常人所能忍受的痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.42,0:10:02.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要嘛一飞冲天
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.25,0:10:04.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要嘛万劫不复
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.13,0:10:08.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,能从铜炉山里出来的绝境鬼王
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.50,0:10:10.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都远比你想象得要可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.63,0:10:14.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我不知花城的目的和动向是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.54,0:10:17.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但他却对上天庭了如指掌
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.63,0:10:18.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.79,0:10:20.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就很不利
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.42,0:10:21.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.79,0:10:22.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,花城他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.13,0:10:25.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,应该不会做太过火的事情的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.25,0:10:26.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,毕竟
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.13,0:10:26.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,您想
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.17,0:10:28.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,以他的实力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.29,0:10:29.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若是要为祸作乱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.00,0:10:32.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,岂不是早就能搅个天翻地覆了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.17,0:10:34.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,既然从前不会
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.83,0:10:35.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那不出意外
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.21,0:10:37.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,想必
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.29,0:10:38.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,今后也不会的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.92,0:10:41.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但愿如此
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.13,0:10:43.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.13,0:10:45.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,为了三界苍生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.00,0:10:48.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我不能冒险
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.29,0:11:10.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,皇儿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.50,0:11:11.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.63,0:11:13.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.08,0:11:25.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.83,0:11:26.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,安乐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.71,0:11:27.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你师父
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.04,0:11:29.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,咱们三个仙乐人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.54,0:11:30.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都有份
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.29,0:11:32.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可是我的父皇母后呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.88,0:11:35.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,永安和仙乐融合
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.00,0:11:37.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,原本是他们最大的心愿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.04,0:11:39.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,现在
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.04,0:11:43.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,父皇母后的心愿实现了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.29,0:11:46.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可他们的下场又是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.50,0:11:47.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,恨一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.13,0:11:49.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,难道不比恨一群人好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.42,0:11:51.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,受什么我也是活该
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.38,0:11:53.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,反正我也死不了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.13,0:11:56.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,全算在我一个人头上不好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.21,0:12:21.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,果子可好吃啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.38,0:12:21.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.96,0:12:22.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不骗你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.79,0:12:23.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,又甜又水灵
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.42,0:12:25.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,下次带你一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.46,0:12:27.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.88,0:12:30.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,攥拳
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.46,0:12:32.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.04,0:12:35.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,手抬高
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.13,0:12:37.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,腿要稳
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.29,0:12:40.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,冲拳
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.25,0:12:42.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,发力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.79,0:12:45.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,再来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.13,0:12:49.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,推掌
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.96,0:12:51.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,换步要快
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.42,0:12:56.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,继续
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.79,0:15:30.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,父皇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.79,0:15:31.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,母后
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.17,0:15:34.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,对不住
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.67,0:15:36.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我忘了带东西来看你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.17,0:15:40.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,母后
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.63,0:15:42.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我遇到戚容了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.00,0:15:43.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这几百年
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.33,0:15:46.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知他究竟经历了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.75,0:15:47.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,化成了鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.54,0:15:49.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还害死了好多人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.88,0:15:51.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,现在有人要杀他
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.92,0:15:53.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,上天庭大概也饶不了他了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.79,0:15:58.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我是真不知该拿这个人怎么办了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.13,0:16:08.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什么声音
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.88,0:16:10.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,娘
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.75,0:16:11.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.25,0:16:14.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不对
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.88,0:16:17.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,母后早在八百年前便脱离了苦海
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.67,0:16:19.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,从不曾化为冤魂
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.63,0:16:21.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,究竟是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.92,0:16:37.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎么是个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.50,0:16:39.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那我母后呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.67,0:16:40.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我母后在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.88,0:16:42.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.54,0:16:45.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你把我母后的尸身弄到哪里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.00,0:17:40.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.38,0:17:42.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,盗墓贼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.79,0:17:43.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你怎么进来的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.50,0:17:45.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,爹爹
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.00,0:17:49.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,爹爹
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.25,0:17:57.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,戚容
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.63,0:17:58.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,滚出来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.54,0:17:59.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我要杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.92,0:18:00.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.04,0:18:03.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子表哥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.17,0:18:04.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,又见面啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.38,0:18:17.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,爹爹
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.75,0:18:21.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你醒醒
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.50,0:18:23.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不要丢下谷子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.25,0:18:28.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,表哥你生什么气啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.67,0:18:30.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我捅你一下你又不会死
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.25,0:18:33.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我母后对你如何
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.88,0:18:34.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你就这样对她
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.04,0:18:36.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这么对待她的尸骨
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.04,0:18:38.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,爹爹
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.75,0:18:45.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,姨母早就死了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.63,0:18:46.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,人都没了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.38,0:18:49.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,尸体是人是粉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.96,0:18:51.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有区别吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.50,0:18:54.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不过是尸体换了个模样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.50,0:18:55.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不还在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.29,0:18:58.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哭哭啼啼的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.92,0:19:01.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,当初对安乐倒下得了狠手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.63,0:19:04.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好表哥居然有两副脸孔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.29,0:19:07.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,呸
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.29,0:19:08.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我为什么这么对她
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.04,0:19:10.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还不都是你的错
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.00,0:19:12.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你这个瘟神
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.38,0:19:14.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也有脸到仙乐皇陵来哭丧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.63,0:19:18.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,对 对
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.25,0:19:20.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.42,0:19:21.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这样才是你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.25,0:19:23.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,狠狠地打
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.29,0:19:24.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,狠狠地杀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.88,0:19:25.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,少装得一副忍辱负重
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.75,0:19:28.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-爹爹 爹爹你怎么了\N-有苦难言的圣人样子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.29,0:19:30.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-爹爹\N-看得人恶心死了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.88,0:19:32.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,戚容
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.04,0:19:33.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.88,0:19:35.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,给我自己滚出来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.38,0:19:36.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,再不出来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.21,0:19:37.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,信不信我拽着你舌头
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.50,0:19:38.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,把你魂魄拉出来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.88,0:19:40.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我不滚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.13,0:19:41.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,倒是你来拽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.92,0:19:44.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,反正这附身的也是个杂碎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.25,0:19:47.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,肯定不会让你太子殿下的圣洁光辉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.21,0:19:48.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有丝毫受损
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.00,0:19:51.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,看看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.29,0:19:54.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我可是把你妈都辗成灰了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.54,0:19:56.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你不杀我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.00,0:19:58.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你不杀我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.42,0:20:00.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,错过了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.38,0:20:03.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-你一辈子都别想找到我的骨灰\N-别杀我爹爹
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.54,0:20:05.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,别杀我爹爹
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.00,0:20:09.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.04,0:20:14.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子表哥
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.75,0:20:15.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,失败啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.13,0:20:17.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,何其的失败啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.50,0:20:20.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-还口口声声爱你的爹妈\N-闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.75,0:20:22.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,现在骨灰都给人扬了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.54,0:20:23.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.29,0:20:24.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,竟然还下不了手
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.00,0:20:25.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.25,0:20:26.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.13,0:20:29.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,露出你真实的嘴脸了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.50,0:20:30.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子表哥
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.75,0:20:33.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,世上会有人比我更懂你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.25,0:20:34.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.04,0:20:38.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我可太清楚了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.13,0:20:41.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你现在虽然一副丧家犬的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.04,0:20:43.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但其实呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.75,0:20:45.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,心里还是那么骄傲
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.54,0:20:47.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,容不得别人说三道四
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.88,0:20:49.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我说你失败
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.50,0:20:51.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你心里一定恨死我了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.00,0:20:54.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是不是刺得心都在滴血啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.42,0:20:56.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.04,0:20:58.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你就来杀了我呀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.92,0:21:01.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还是说因为这个人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.88,0:21:03.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你就不敢了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.63,0:21:06.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,让我看看你到底会怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.38,0:21:26.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,花将军
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.92,0:21:29.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我曾以为我做了对的事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.92,0:21:30.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可现在
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.13,0:21:32.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我不知道什么是对的了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.63,0:21:34.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,花将军
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.75,0:21:36.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你能不能告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.38,0:21:38.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我到底哪里做得不够好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.38,0:21:40.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,究竟是哪一步出了问题
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.63,0:21:41.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,师父
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.00,0:21:45.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如果那第三个人的粮食也不够怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.63,0:21:49.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如果那两个人有了粮食
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.17,0:21:50.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-却因为贪\N-安乐
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.29,0:21:51.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-想要更多\N-你知不知道你犯下了大错
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.38,0:21:52.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-打得更凶\N-原来你是国师
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.88,0:21:55.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不断向第三个人索取粮食
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.00,0:21:56.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,-那又该怎么办啊\N-你藏得也太深了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.79,0:21:57.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这下好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.83,0:22:00.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我们可以一起去干一番大事业
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.88,0:22:03.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,现在洗了鎏金宴
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.75,0:22:05.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,再去杀了郎千秋
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.04,0:22:07.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,搅得永安翻天覆地
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.00,0:22:09.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,永无安宁
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.79,0:22:12.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,听我的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.54,0:22:13.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你没有错
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.29,0:22:15.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,杀永安王
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.50,0:22:16.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,保仙乐遗民
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.38,0:22:18.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,杀安乐王
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.50,0:22:20.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,保两族不再起纷争
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.88,0:22:21.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,最后
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.00,0:22:23.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,死于郎千秋之手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.75,0:22:24.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,凶手伏诛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.13,0:22:27.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三条人命
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.42,0:22:28.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,换几世太平
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.00,0:22:30.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是我也会这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.38,0:22:34.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,谁也不会做得比你更好了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.75,0:22:36.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三郎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.75,0:22:39.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不要把某个人想象得太过美好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.88,0:22:44.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若一辈子只是远观倒也罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.67,0:22:46.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一旦靠近
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.29,0:22:48.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,相识相知
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.67,0:22:52.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,完美的幻影终究会有破碎的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.13,0:22:55.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,到那时候
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.88,0:22:58.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你会很失望的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.63,0:23:01.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,去你的仙乐太子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.17,0:23:04.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你祖祖辈辈世世代代都是仙乐太子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.63,0:23:05.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,瘟神
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.50,0:23:06.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他就是个瘟神
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.50,0:23:08.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,把我妻儿的命还回来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.75,0:23:09.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,还命来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.17,0:23:12.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.33,0:23:15.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,忘了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.29,0:23:19.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,反正很快就会没人记得了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.08,0:23:22.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.63,0:23:25.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不会的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.54,0:23:28.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我不会忘的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.13,0:23:34.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我永远也不会忘了你的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.71,0:23:55.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.13,0:23:57.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,这次
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.67,0:24:00.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我想陪你走到最后
